Original markdown (docs/wiki, docs/catalog, community files, tests) is Apache-2.0.

data/corpus summaries are project-authored extracts tagged official-not-relicensed
where they quote law. They do not replace SIDOF, Diputados, or SAT.

data/originals MANIFEST.yaml rows describe Mexican government publications
(Cámara de Diputados, SAT, SIDOF/DOF, Secretaría de Economía, VUCEM, SNICE,
INEGI) and treaties / intergovernmental texts (T-MEC, other TLCs, WTO).
Those works are not re-licensed as original authorship. Binding citation
is the official URL. Bytes are GitHub Release assets (originals-YYYY.MM.DD).

Incoterms® is a trademark of the International Chamber of Commerce.
This repository cites ICC catalog URLs only. It does not include Incoterms
rule text, ICC PDFs, or the wallchart.
